# Witness for DeferredCloseMeetsCoreResolve. The resolution's check is replaced by FALSE, so the
# invariant fails exactly when a kept resolution of a deferred head is reachable.
MODULE: DeferredCloseMeetsCoreResolveWitness
TARGET: DeferredCloseMeetsCoreResolve
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a deferred head's resolution is reachable: the edge's check is not vacuous

--- FIND
Fails("DeferredCloseMeetsCoreResolve", CResolveDeferred)
--- REPLACE
Fails("DeferredCloseMeetsCoreResolve", FALSE)
--- END
